<title>USA: Chicago Rivet buys H&amp;L Tool assets.</title>
<headline>Chicago Rivet buys H&amp;L Tool assets.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Rivet &amp; Machine Co said it executed a purchase and sale agreement to acquire substantially all the assets of H&amp;L Tool Co Inc for about $19.1 million in cash and liability assumption.</p>
<p>Closing is expected on October 31, the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
